#: ../../source/example/Plot-descriptor.md:1 eca6fbf9358a402d8b06b92c2e958b91
msgid "描述符分布绘图示例"
msgstr "Descriptor Distribution Plot Example"

#: ../../source/example/Plot-descriptor.md:3 f84626322bbb4a2f931dfc52433b74ca
msgid ""
"想比较几类结构（例如 CsPbI3 的立方、四方和正交相）在描述符空间里的覆盖范围时，可以分别导出它们的描述符， "
"再用仓库提供的脚本画在同一张图上。本例最终得到一张带边界线的描述符散点图，颜色表示每原子能量。"
msgstr "To compare how several groups of structures (for example, the cubic, tetragonal, and orthorhombic phases of CsPbI3) cover descriptor space, export their descriptors separately and plot them together with the script in the repository. The result is a descriptor scatter plot with boundary lines, colored by energy per atom."

#: ../../source/example/Plot-descriptor.md:6 d84fb33b71e54b14be864761a2d1bf76
msgid "![NEP 数据集查看中的描述符图](../_static/image/example/plot_descriptor/main_ui.png)"
msgstr "![Descriptor plot in NEP Dataset Display](../_static/image/example/plot_descriptor/main_ui.png)"

#: ../../source/example/Plot-descriptor.md:6 d56c856abaaf4d088e776a61fb74b24b
msgid "NEP 数据集查看中的描述符图"
msgstr "Descriptor plot in NEP Dataset Display"

#: ../../source/example/Plot-descriptor.md:6 d56c856abaaf4d088e776a61fb74b24b
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/example/plot_descriptor/main_ui.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/example/Plot-descriptor.md:8 975c79302bb6449ba2c5ee6f248427b0
msgid "1. 分别导出每类结构的描述符"
msgstr "1. Export descriptors for each group"

#: ../../source/example/Plot-descriptor.md:10 483314acc48c450da119b99a0d00ddfe
msgid "在 `NEP 数据集查看` 中打开包含这些结构的数据，然后对每一类结构重复："
msgstr "Open the data containing these structures in `NEP Dataset Display`, then repeat for each group:"

#: ../../source/example/Plot-descriptor.md:12 7ed47c78b729448db5d2a7c5788bc938
#
msgid ""
"选中这一类结构：可以用工具栏 <img "
"src=\"../_static/image/generated/show_nep_icons/pen.svg\" alt=\"鼠标选择\" "
"width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /> `鼠标选择` 在描述符图上圈选，也可以用筛选栏按 `Config_type` 选中。"
msgstr "Select the structures in this group: draw a selection on the descriptor plot with <img src=\"../_static/image/generated/show_nep_icons/pen.svg\" alt=\"Mouse Selection\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /> `Mouse Selection`, or select them by `Config_type` in the filter bar."

#: ../../source/example/Plot-descriptor.md:12 253746b4642d4e1798d2b84c25eb4571
msgid "鼠标选择"
msgstr "Mouse Selection"

#: ../../source/example/Plot-descriptor.md:12 253746b4642d4e1798d2b84c25eb4571
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/show_nep_icons/pen.svg"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/example/Plot-descriptor.md:13 2a104196c0664fa4a64d52882b7206a6
#
msgid ""
"点击工具栏 <img src=\"../_static/image/generated/show_nep_icons/export.svg\" "
"alt=\"导出结构描述符\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /> `导出结构描述符`。"
msgstr "Click <img src=\"../_static/image/generated/show_nep_icons/export.svg\" alt=\"Export structure descriptor\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" /> `Export structure descriptor` on the toolbar."

#: ../../source/example/Plot-descriptor.md:13 afb72b5a12fa4653b8f5fcb1539fcf84
msgid "导出结构描述符"
msgstr "Export structure descriptor"

#: ../../source/example/Plot-descriptor.md:13 afb72b5a12fa4653b8f5fcb1539fcf84
msgid ".. image:: ../_static/image/generated/show_nep_icons/export.svg"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/example/Plot-descriptor.md:14 ad36f2ec68ad49ddbfc2838316cc52c2
msgid "选择保存路径，例如 `cubic_descriptor.out`。"
msgstr "Choose a save path, for example `cubic_descriptor.out`."

#: ../../source/example/Plot-descriptor.md:16 ac1728d6368e4fc5983b3dd07d3894b9
msgid ""
"导出文件只包含**当前选中**的结构。每行对应一个结构：前两列是描述符图上的两个坐标； "
"数据中有能量时，第三列是每原子能量。没有选中任何结构时不会生成文件。"
msgstr "The exported file contains only the **currently selected** structures. Each row is one structure: the first two columns are its coordinates on the descriptor plot, and the third column is the energy per atom when energies are available. No file is written when nothing is selected."

#: ../../source/example/Plot-descriptor.md:19 c18f54a006fd4e73a6c1926471889d3e
msgid "2. 配置并运行绘图脚本"
msgstr "2. Configure and run the plotting script"

#: ../../source/example/Plot-descriptor.md:21 1b09f3a8ebc540f7b2ed725c59a398ef
#
msgid ""
"下载 [plot_descriptor.py](https://github.com/aboys-"
"cb/NepTrainKit/blob/master/tools/plot_descriptor.py)， "
"放在导出文件所在的目录，然后修改脚本开头的两项："
msgstr "Download [plot_descriptor.py](https://github.com/aboys-cb/NepTrainKit/blob/master/tools/plot_descriptor.py), place it next to the exported files, and edit the two settings at the top of the script:"

#: ../../source/example/Plot-descriptor.md:24 dd1ee95e503d4f698b8ce97567869a6f
msgid ""
"`config`：每类结构一行，依次写描述符文件路径、图例名称和标记符号，例如 `(\"./cubic_descriptor.out\", "
"\"cubic\", \"*\")`。"
msgstr "`config`: one row per group, giving the descriptor file path, legend label, and marker, for example `(\"./cubic_descriptor.out\", \"cubic\", \"*\")`."

#: ../../source/example/Plot-descriptor.md:26 ba4cde13ff3f48ae9086f91d922b65b6
msgid ""
"`method`：边界线的画法。`alphashape` 需要先安装 `alphashape` 包；`dbscan` 需要先安装 `scikit-"
"learn`。"
msgstr "`method`: how boundary lines are drawn. `alphashape` requires the `alphashape` package; `dbscan` requires `scikit-learn`."

#: ../../source/example/Plot-descriptor.md:28 5847151c591f44bd9708c20a02360d1a
msgid "脚本使用第三列给散点上色，所以导出的数据需要带能量。运行："
msgstr "The script colors points by the third column, so the exported data must include energies. Run:"

#: ../../source/example/Plot-descriptor.md:30 5402a2fef6d04943b401421c2358055d
msgid "python plot_descriptor.py\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/example/Plot-descriptor.md:34 72042893e1d742768573d11de3efd161
msgid "结果保存为当前目录下的 `descriptor_scatter_plot.png`："
msgstr "The result is saved as `descriptor_scatter_plot.png` in the current directory:"

#: ../../source/example/Plot-descriptor.md:36 e58a935bfdb347c0bbc63d68b57d7c55
msgid "![描述符散点图](../_static/image/example/plot_descriptor/descriptor_scatter_plot.png)"
msgstr "![Descriptor scatter plot](../_static/image/example/plot_descriptor/descriptor_scatter_plot.png)"

#: ../../source/example/Plot-descriptor.md:36 f4118e23e07d435796207ff4c5e6c362
msgid "描述符散点图"
msgstr "Descriptor scatter plot"

#: ../../source/example/Plot-descriptor.md:36 f4118e23e07d435796207ff4c5e6c362
msgid ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/example/plot_descriptor/descriptor_scatter_plot.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/example/Plot-descriptor.md:38 78eccd1dc22f48c8b66eb3506b764207
msgid "3. 怎么读这张图"
msgstr "3. How to read the plot"

#: ../../source/example/Plot-descriptor.md:40 e722714e1af3461499bb3e2696a47d62
msgid "原始描述符超过两维时，图中展示的是 PCA 二维投影。点云分开说明这些结构在该投影上有差异；重叠不能证明原始描述符相近，也不能据此判断模型难以区分它们。"
msgstr "When the original descriptors have more than two dimensions, the plot shows a two-dimensional PCA projection. Separated point clouds indicate differences in this projection; overlap does not establish similarity in the original descriptor space or imply that the model cannot distinguish the structures."

#: ../../source/example/Plot-descriptor.md:41 05aa4f69b57e4d78a96587c8a308c009
msgid "某一类只覆盖很小的区域，不一定缺少多样性：结构差异可能位于未显示的维度。是否补充结构，需要结合原始描述符空间的覆盖和实际结构变化判断。"
msgstr "A group occupying a small region does not necessarily lack diversity: structural differences may lie in dimensions that are not shown. Decide whether to add structures by checking coverage in the original descriptor space together with actual structural variation."

#: ../../source/example/Plot-descriptor.md:42 0c51a3fb94a940a89dc4614c84c19080
msgid "同一位置颜色差别很大，只说明投影位置相近但每原子能量不同。可以在 `NEP 数据集查看` 中抽查这些结构，再核对原始描述符和模型误差；这张图本身不能证明采样充分或模型可靠。"
msgstr "Very different colors at the same position only indicate similar projected coordinates with different energies per atom. Inspect these structures in `NEP Dataset Display`, then check their original descriptors and model errors; the plot alone cannot establish sufficient sampling or model reliability."

